#   agent turn 7, 348 tokens: 2.60 -> 1.49 s, 50 + 50 moved in 32 ms: about 1.14 s back.
# A follow costs about 0.30 ms an expert moved. Between 36 and 348 rows the copies give back about 3.5 ms a row more
#   (gain(rows) = g36 + (g348 - g36) * (rows - 36) / 312, g36 = 53 ms, g348 = 1142 ms);
