# Without a history: no .coli_usage anywhere, USAGE_SAVE=0 on every run, so the warm start has no history and fills the card by
#   its own order. v dev = origin/dev c1c06ac6 (qwen38 built with make qwen38 CUDA=1 CUDA_ARCH=native; sha256 of the binary 53bcd12758514e853433d2c89b50bf9237f4866bb802439efd15a8f81b9aa14b),
#   v pr = 1fdb58d9, this PR (same build; sha256 98ecfa8c47831e372f162044c2d293e08db084410d2d4d3f287c32f20672e90f). Each run's warm-start line says which order it ran:
#   'no history: in order' (dev) or 'no history: expert by expert across the layers' (this PR), and serie.sh stopped at the
#   first run whose line, exit status or full host pool was not the one expected.
# Model files: unsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF UD-Q2_K_XL/*, sha256 checked against sha256-attesi.sha (3 of 3 OK), imported with
