| trunk | without head | with head | acceptance |
|---|---|---|---|
| int8 | 37.6 tok/s | 44.4 tok/s | 90.6% |
| int4 | 45.6 tok/s | 52.0 tok/s | 89.0% |

A separate depth comparison measured 65.3 / 63.0 / 63.0 tok/s and 1.78 / 2.07 /
