      <div class="s1">
        <div class="card form">
          <div><h2 class="h2">System One</h2><p class="sub">Il modello non scrive: legge quanto è probabile ogni opzione e lo dice con un numero. Entropia alta vuol dire che non sa, ed è la cosa che una risposta scritta non sa dirti.</p></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Contesto <small>il testo su cui decidere: una PR, un messaggio, una pratica</small></label>
            <textarea class="area" id="s1ctx" rows="6"></textarea></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Domanda</label><input class="input" id="s1q"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Opzioni ammesse <small>una per riga</small></label><textarea class="area" id="s1opts" rows="3"></textarea></div>
          <div class="row"><button class="sbtn sbtn--primary" id="s1go">Assegna le probabilità</button><span class="sub" id="s1err" style="margin:0"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" id="s1out">
          <div class="row"><h2 class="h2">Risposta</h2><span class="spacer"></span><span class="badge" id="s1sure">in attesa</span></div>
          <p class="sub" id="s1empty">Nessuna risposta ancora.</p>
          <div id="s1bars"></div>
          <div class="s1meta" id="s1meta"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></div></section>

    <!-- =================== MONITOR (+ PROFILING) -->
    <section class="view" id="view-monitor"><div class="page__body"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="row"><div class="tabs" id="monTabs"><button class="tab" aria-selected="true" data-mt="over">Panoramica</button><button class="tab" aria-selected="false" data-mt="prof">Profiling</button></div><span class="spacer"></span><span class="status" id="monStatus" data-ok="false"><i></i>in attesa del motore</span></div>
      <div id="mon-over" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="state__head"><h2 class="h2">Stato del modello</h2>
            <div class="state__badges" id="stBadges"><span class="badge" data-k="idle">Fermo</span><span class="badge badge--info" data-k="reading">Legge</span><span class="badge badge--accent" data-k="gen">Scrive</span><span class="badge" data-k="queued">In coda</span><span class="badge" data-k="error">Errore</span></div>
            <span class="spacer"></span><span class="sub" style="margin:0" id="stModel"></span></div>
          <div class="state__row"><strong id="stLabel">Fermo</strong><span class="muted" id="stDetail"></span></div>
          <div class="livegrid">
            <div class="livenum"><span>Velocità adesso</span><b id="lvTps">-</b><small id="lvTpsSub">tok/s</small></div>
            <div class="livenum"><span>Token scritti</span><b id="lvTok">-</b><small id="lvTokSub"></small></div>
            <div class="livenum"><span>Prompt</span><b id="lvPrompt">-</b><small id="lvPromptSub">token</small></div>
            <div class="livenum"><span>Token per passo</span><b id="lvTpf">-</b><small id="lvTpfSub">MTP</small></div>
            <div class="livenum"><span>CPU del motore</span><b id="lvCpu">-</b><small id="lvCpuSub"></small></div>
            <div class="livenum"><span>RAM del motore</span><b id="lvRss">-</b><small id="lvRssSub"></small></div>
          </div>
          <svg class="livechart" id="lvChart" viewBox="0 0 240 48" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg>
          <div class="chart__foot"><span>tok/s, ultimi 2 minuti</span><span id="lvPeak"></span></div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="h2 monsec">Ultimo turno finito</h2>
        <div class="metrics" id="metrics"></div>
        <div class="row2">
          <div class="card">
            <h2 class="h2" id="gaugeTitle">Contesto dell'ultimo turno</h2>
            <div class="gauge"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 150"><circle cx="75" cy="75" r="62" fill="none" stroke="var(--surface-2)" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="292 390"/><circle id="gaugeFill" cx="75" cy="75" r="62" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="0 390"/></svg>
              <div class="gauge__read"><b id="gaugePct">0%</b><span class="sub" style="margin:0" id="gaugeSub"></span></div></div>
            <div id="monBars"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:6px"><h2 class="h2">Turni recenti</h2></div>
            <div class="tablewrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Turno</th><th class="num">Prompt</th><th class="num">Output</th><th class="num">Tok/s</th><th class="num">Token per passo</th><th class="num">Durata</th><th class="num">Disco</th></tr></thead><tbody id="reqBody"></tbody></table></div>
            <p class="demo-note" style="margin-top:10px">Tok/s qui è sul turno intero, lettura del prompt compresa.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="mon-prof" style="display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
        <div class="card"><div class="row"><h2 class="h2">Dove il motore spende ogni turno</h2><span class="spacer"></span><div class="legend" id="profLegend"></div></div></div>
        <div class="tiles" id="profTiles"></div>
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px" id="profShares"></div>
        <div class="charts">
          <div class="card chart"><div class="chart__title">Velocità per turno (tok/s)</div><svg id="profThr" viewBox="0 0 100 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg><div class="chart__foot"><span id="profThrFoot"></span><span id="profThrPeak"></span></div></div>
          <div class="card chart"><div class="chart__title">Tempo per turno per fase (s)</div><svg id="profPh" viewBox="0 0 100 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg><div class="chart__foot"><span id="profPhFoot"></span><span id="profPhPeak"></span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tablewrap"><table class="table" id="profTable"></table></div>
          <p class="demo-note" style="margin-top:10px">Il servizio disco è il tempo speso a leggere gli esperti sui thread di I/O: si sovrappone al calcolo, quindi conta solo l'attesa I/O che si sente davvero.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></div></section>

    <!-- =================== EXPERT MAP -->
    <section class="view" id="view-map"><div class="page__body"><div class="wrap">
